units metal
dimension 3
boundary p p f
atom_style atomic
lattice bcc 1.0
region whole block 0 20 0 20 0 75 units lattice
create_box 1 whole
region projectile block 0 20 0 20 0 20 units lattice
create_atoms 1 region projectile
region target block 0 20 0 20 35 75 units lattice
create_atoms 1 region target
mass 1 92.906
group projectile region projectile
group target region target
pair_style eam/alloy
pair_coeff * * ../../../potentials/prompt1.potential Nb
neighbor 2.0 bin
neigh_modify every 1 delay 0 check yes
velocity all create 300.0 12345 mom yes rot no dist gaussian
fix equil all nvt temp 300.0 300.0 0.1
timestep 0.001
run 100000
unfix equil
velocity projectile set 0.0 0.0 20.0 sum yes
fix impact all nve
run 100000